  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Luck Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/Yusei_Kurusu_%28Luck_Stealer%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20251220004700\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Yusei Kurusu (Luck Stealer)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/Yusei_Kurusu_%28Luck_Stealer%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20251220004700\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/Yusei_Kurusu_%28Luck_Stealer%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20251220004700 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/Yusei_Kurusu_%28Luck_Stealer%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20251220004700 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Yusei Kurusu (Luck Stealer)\" width=\"270\" height=\"392\" data-image-key=\"Yusei_Kurusu_%28Luck_Stealer%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Yusei Kurusu (Luck Stealer).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Yusei Kurusu (Luck Stealer) is an mercenary with the power to steal peoples luck.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb luck.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb luck and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Probability_Manipulation\" title=\"Probability Manipulation\">Probability Manipulation</a>. Variation of  <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Luck\" title=\"Luck\">Luck</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Jinx_Absorption\" title=\"Jinx Absorption\">Jinx Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fortune Absorption</li>\n<li>Luck Stealing</li>\n<li>Luck Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb luck, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Automatic_Self-Preservation\" title=\"Automatic Self-Preservation\">Automatic Self-Preservation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jinx\" title=\"Jinx\">Jinx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Luck\" title=\"Luck\">Luck</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Luck_Augmentation\" title=\"Luck Augmentation\">Luck Augmentation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Luckiness_Manipulation\" title=\"Luckiness Manipulation\">Luckiness Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Probability_Manipulation\" title=\"Probability Manipulation\">Probability Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be constantly active.</li>\n<li>Good luck may run out.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLuck_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://arrow.fandom.com/wiki/Becky_Sharpe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Arrowverse:Becky Sharpe\">Becky Sharpe/Hazard</a> (<i>Arrowverse</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arrow.fandom.com/wiki/Clifford_DeVoe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Arrowverse:Clifford DeVoe\">Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker</a> (<i>Arrowverse/The Flash 2014</i>); After transferring his consciousness into Becky's body.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://binbougamiga.fandom.com/wiki/Ichiko_Sakura\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:binbougamiga:Ichiko Sakura\">Ichiko Sakura</a> (<i>Binbougami Ga!</i>)</li>\n<li>Jugram Haschwalth (<i>Bleach</i>); via Freund Schild absorbing misfortune.</li>\n<li>Hata Takafudou (<i>D-Frag!</i>)</li>\n<li>Vriska Serket (<i>Homestuck</i>)</li>\n<li>Samuel Berg (<i>Intacto</i>)</li>\n<li>Ashley Albright and Jake Hardin (<i>Just My Luck</i>); take each other's luck with a kiss.</li>\n<li>Mayer (<i>Lost Girl</i>)</li>\n<li>Kurusu Yuusei (<i>Luck Stealer</i>)</li>\n<li>Starjun (<i>Toriko</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Baccarat\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Baccarat\">Baccarat</a> (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://supernatural.fandom.com/wiki/Binb%C5%8Dgami\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:Supernatural:Binbōgami\">Binbōgami</a> (<i>Supernatural: The Animation</i>)</li>\n<li>Alakshmi (<i>Yakui yo! Alakshmi</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><sp